"},{"role":"myth","text":"And the fast spin is not what washes the clothes."},{"role":"mythFact","text":"Washing is a slow tumble, roughly 40 to 60 rpm, where ribs lift clothes and drop them through soapy water."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a glass door, a soap drawer and a dial to the machine."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a washing machine."}]}